# Vendored third-party source: odo_gen (from upstream odo-miner)

`odo_gen.cpp`, `odocrypt.h`, and `odocrypt.cpp` in this directory are a
vendored subset of the upstream `odo-miner` project (MentalCollatz), the same
per-epoch OdoCrypt RTL generator used to originally produce
`exmaples/odocrypt/fpga/src/hdl/encrypt.v` (the stock AM01/vendor example,
left at its original upstream epoch) and now used to keep
`hdl/odocrypt/encrypt.v` (the shared core the real board builds use) current.

- Upstream:      https://github.com/MentalCollatz/odo-miner
- Copied from:   a local checkout of `colneech-dev/odo-miner-cyclonev`
                  (`third_party/odo-miner/`), which pins upstream commit
                  `fb1bd94892e3b1893bfc2439ebec877b25856b18` (heads/master),
                  vendored there on 2026-06-27.
- Copied here:   2026-08-13, so `am01` can regenerate/verify per-epoch RTL
                  without needing a checkout of odo-miner-cyclonev.
- Scope:         only the 3 files needed to build the `odo_gen` binary
                  (`src/verilog/odo_gen.cpp` + `src/crypto/odocrypt.{h,cpp}`
                  from upstream). The `#include "../crypto/odocrypt.h"` in
                  `odo_gen.cpp` was flattened to `#include "odocrypt.h"`
                  since all three files now live in one directory; no other
                  changes were made.

